GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "D50E55541D34A251"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{FD770811A7846158}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "OPORD"
     m_sContent "<b>1. SITUATION</b>"\
     "a. Enemy Forces: 2 Argentinian platoons dug-in on “Summer Days” south east from Start line “Pub Garden”. They occupy well-sited shell scrapes and makeshift bunkers supported by HMG nests. Possible reinforcements from adjacent attacks on “mt. harriet” and long toe nail reinforcing from the enemy rear. "\
     "Likely Access to mortars and artillery."\
     "b. Friendly Forces: Z Coy is the main effort and will be conducting an assault from the north west on Summer Days, Y Coy will follow up, X Coy will assault “Long toenail” approx 3 Hours before H hour. Z and Y Coy Mortars are allocated for support Attack on “Summer Days”."\
     "c. Attachments:"\
     "Naval Gunfire Officer with Comm to HMS Glamorgan for Gunfire Support."\
     "Weather."\
     "Light cloud, ¾ moon, fair wind"\
     ""\
     "<b>2. MISSION</b>"\
     "Commencing at H-Hour (120030Z), Z Company is to ATTACK to SEIZE “Summer Days”"\
     ""\
     "<b>3. EXECUTION</b>"\
     "a. Tasks to Subordinate Units:"\
     "Tasks to all platoons and attachments will be issued verbally by the OC (per CO)."\
     "b. Coordinating Instructions:"\
     "Recognition:"\
     "Password/Countersign: ARMY / CRABS."\
     ""\
     "<b>4. SERVICE SUPPORT</b>"\
     "a. Ammunition: Company mortars have 20 HE (2x tubes) and 200 Smoke (3x tubes) for fire support tasks. (TOT 30s, 6s reload, 30m dispersion ) 39.5MHz"\
     "An ammo box with Schermulys will be at Z Coy supply point(spawn location)."\
     "HMS glamorgan on station with 58 4.5 inch HE (TOT 150s, 2s reload, 100m dispersion)   38.5MHz"\
     "b. Casualties: CCP Per Troop Cdrs."\
     "c. CPers: To be disarmed, searched, and held at the CCP for escort to the rear."\
     "d. Air Support: Prep fires cease at 112100z "\
     ""\
     "<b>5. COMMAND & SIGNAL</b>"\
     "a. Command:"\
     "Chain of Command: OC, Coy 2iC, OC 7 Troop."\
     "b. Signals:"\
     "Z Company 45MHz"\
     "7 Troop 46MHz"\
     "8 Troop 47MHz"\
     "9 Troop 48MHz"\
     "Codewords:"\
     "\"Summer Nights\" - “Summer Days” Seized."\
     "\"SUNRAY\" - Callsign IC."\
     "\"Scrum Call\" - Call for immediate Fire support."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0580ECFF4010D742}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "Z COY assaults summer days as part part of operations to capture Two Sisters."\
     ""\
     "NOTES ON ARTILLERY: To use open radio menu (default G) switch to the correct frequency and double tap C. Coords are in EIGHT DIGIT CODES."\
     ""\
     "Illum is cancelled due to technical difficulties. "
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5EE58497C5E43E1C}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "OPORD"
     m_sContent "<b>1. SITUATION</b>"\
     "a. Enemy Forces: 3 British platoons preparing for an attack on the north east ridgeline of Dos Hermanas from the north west. "\
     "Likely Access to mortars and artillery."\
     "9 platoon on the Southwest Ridgeline of Dos Hermanas under attack from company sized forces at current time."\
     "b. Friendly Forces: 5 platoon (AI) is deployed along our ridgeline in dug in positions with HMG’s already. 6 platoon (Players) is to reinforce 5 platoon and repel any attack on the northeast ridgeline., Reinforcements (respawns) from friendly forces retreating from Monte Harriet will reinforce from our rear of axis(your spawn point). Company Mortars are allocated to support our defense."\
     "Battalion will call in 155mm Artillery on any initial attacks by enemy forces however reliability is limited due to other ongoing operations and counter fires."\
     "c. Attachments:"\
     "None."\
     "Weather."\
     "Light cloud, ¾ moon, fair wind"\
     ""\
     "<b>2. MISSION</b>"\
     "Resist or Stall any attack on the Northeast ridge of Dos Hermanas."\
     "3. EXECUTION"\
     "a. Tasks to Subordinate Units:"\
     "Tasks to Sections will be issued verbally by the OC (per CO)."\
     "b. Coordinating Instructions:"\
     "Recognition:"\
     "Password/Countersign: per CO."\
     ""\
     "<b>4. SERVICE SUPPORT</b>"\
     "a. Ammunition: Company mortars have 50 HE (2x tubes) and 60 Smoke (3x tubes) for fire support tasks. (TOT 30s, 6s reload, 30m dispersion ) 39.5MHz"\
     "An ammo box with Schermulys will be at 6 platoon supply point(spawn location)."\
     "b. Casualties: CCP per CO."\
     "c. CPers: To be disarmed, searched, and held at the CCP for escort to the rear."\
     ""\
     "<b>5. COMMAND & SIGNAL</b>"\
     "a. Command:"\
     "Chain of Command: OC, platoon 2iC, OC 1 section."\
     "b. Signals:"\
     "5 platoon 45MHz"\
     "6 platoon 46MHz"\
     "9 platoon 49MHz"\
     "Codewords:"\
     "per CO"\
     ""\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_ARG"
     }
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
